# 8. Web-first layout

This is a **website**, not an app delivered through a browser.

Desktop and mobile should not simply share one vertically stacked layout.

---

## Desktop

Use the horizontal space intentionally.

Preferred logged-in structure:

```text
┌──────────────┬────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┐
│              │                    │                              │
│ navigation   │ recommendation     │ selected recommendation      │
│              │ list               │ detail                       │
│              │                    │                              │
│ put me on    │                    │                              │
│              │                    │                              │
└──────────────┴────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────┘
```

### Left rail

Persistent.

Something like:

```text
put me on

inbox
sent
me

+ put someone on


Vyomi
settings
```

Do not overstyle it.

No boxes around every nav item.

---

## Master/detail behavior

Inbox and Sent should benefit from desktop.

### Center

Recommendation history.

### Right

Selected recommendation.

This makes Put Me On feel like a purposeful desktop website rather than an enlarged phone app.

The detail pane can contain:

* larger album artwork
* sender relationship
* song
* artist
* note
* listen
* response
* source/pass-on history

---

## Mobile web

Do not use:

* bottom navigation
* floating action buttons
* full-time hamburger as the only navigation

Instead:

```text
put me on               + put someone on

inbox        sent        me
```

Or another compact top-navigation treatment.

Settings can live behind the user's name/avatar.

If necessary, secondary account controls can use a small menu, but **core product destinations should remain visible**.

Design mobile on a raw ~390px web canvas, not inside an iPhone mockup during product iteration.

---

# 9. Navigation

## V1

Primary:

* Inbox
* Sent
* Me
* Put someone on

Secondary:

* account/settings

No:

* Feed
* Explore
* Notifications
* public profile
* search tab

---

## Future

Feed should only appear after direct recommendation behavior is proven.

Potential future IA:

```text
Inbox    Feed    Sent    Me
             + Put someone on
```

But Feed must always mean:

> recommendation activity between people

not:

> content people posted.

